title: The defection — a conversation Kemp carries to its end
story: ides-of-march
author: Sharpee Platform
seed: 42
description: The clown's defection as a conversation only he can
  finish. Before the grievance is aired the Rose gets a brush-off;
  raw after the blow-up it gets a refusal; cooled, Kemp opens the talk
  himself and holds it against every other subject until it is sworn.
  Continuation prompts advance it; the open offer holds it; the sworn
  conclusion is a fact the topic table reads afterward.
  Run: node dist/cli/sharpee.js --test
    --story stories/ides-of-march/chord/ides-of-march.story
    stories/ides-of-march/tests/transcripts/threads-defection.transcript

