# Off the subject mid-thread: refused back into it, in his own words —
# and he presses straight on to the question.
> ask kemp about the ale
[OK: contains "THIS first"]
[OK: contains "Ask me the question Philip sent"]

# The open offer holds everything — even the prompt forms.
> continue
[OK: contains "Talk to whom?"]

# The answer, and the conclusion on its heels.
> ask kemp about yes
[OK: contains "Sworn, then"]
[OK: contains "finished WELL"]

# Conclusion is a fact: the table reads it.
> ask kemp about the rose
[OK: contains "That matter is settled"]
